SUMMARY:UC Carpentries: Core Elements of Citable and Discoverable Research
  Software
DESCRIPTION:Learn practical steps for making research software citable\, d
 iscoverable\, and reusable. Working in your browser with a GitHub reposito
 ry\, you will add an open-source license\, create a CITATION.cff file\, ma
 ke a versioned release with a DOI and improve project documentation and me
 tadata. This hands-on workshop is designed for researchers and the profess
 ionals who support them.\n\nThis event is co-presented by the UC OSPO Netw
 ork and UC Carpentries.\n\nThis workshop is free and participants can regi
 ster for individual topics or the entire series. View the complete schedul
 e and register.
